				"code" : "sorted := (dictLenguajes associations sorted: [:a :b | a value > b value]).\r\ntop4 := sorted first: 4.\r\nrest := sorted allButFirst: 4.\r\nrestTotal := rest inject: 0 into: [:sum :assoc | sum + assoc value].\r\ntotal := (top4 inject: restTotal into: [:sum :assoc | sum + assoc value]) asFloat.\r\notrosDict := Dictionary new.\r\notrosDict at: 'Otros' put: restTotal.\r\ntop5 := top4 copy , otrosDict associations.\r\n\r\ntop5 do: [:assoc |\r\n    porcentaje := (assoc value asFloat / total * 100) roundTo: 0.01.\r\n    Transcript\r\n        show: assoc key , ': ' , assoc value printString , ' (' , porcentaje printString , '%)';\r\n        cr.\r\n]."
